WEBVTT

00:07:01.454 --> 00:07:08.121
Life's beauty is inseparable from its
fragility. We are young until we are not.

00:07:09.038 --> 00:07:13.621
We walk down the street sexy until one
day we realize that we are unseen.

00:07:16.704 --> 00:07:19.996
We nag our children and one day realize
that there is silence with

00:07:19.996 --> 00:07:22.788
a child once was now making his
or her way in the world.

00:07:24.246 --> 00:07:29.079
We are healthy until a diagnosis
brings us to our knees.